<title>POLAND: New Bytom shares to trade from Jan 20.</title>
<headline>New Bytom shares to trade from Jan 20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish garment maker Bytom SA said on Tusday that 250,000 of its newly issued shares will be traded on the Warsaw bourse from January 20.</p>
<p>It said the new shares will increase Bytom's publiclly traded shares to 750,000.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
